{"id":"prepositions-0052","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 52","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"from","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Can I borrow a pen ___ you?","hint":"borrow ___ / lend ___","explanation":"borrow FROM (take), lend TO (give)."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The project failed through a lack ___ funding.","hint":"lack ___ sth","explanation":"a lack OF something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The surgeon operated ___ the patient for four hours.","hint":"operate ___ sb","explanation":"operate ON a patient (for a condition)."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She\u0027s perfectly capable ___ managing the project alone.","hint":"capable ___ doing","explanation":"capable OF doing something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He spends far too much ___ computer games.","hint":"spend money/time ___ sth","explanation":"spend money/time ON something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Be kind ___ your little brother.","hint":"kind ___ sb","explanation":"kind TO somebody."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"She soon got tired ___ answering the same questions.","hint":"tired ___ sth (bored)","explanation":"tired OF something = bored/annoyed by it; tired FROM = physically exhausted."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The film had an immediate effect ___ audiences.","hint":"effect ___ sth","explanation":"have an effect ON somebody/something."}]}